License scope
=============
The newly authored observation-v3 implementation is provided under the MIT
license below, except for the separately attributed materials listed here.

- src/symm_observation/codec.py is an adapted inference subset of the
  MeWM-derived VQ implementation in cgznb/symm-fm. It remains CC BY-NC 4.0.
- upstream_reference/three_phase_symmflow.py is the original source reference
  from the first_post_three_phase workflow of cgznb/symm-fm. The upstream
  workflow's CC BY-NC 4.0 terms are retained.
- src/symm_observation/layers.py retains the attribution notices for the
  ConvNeXt/torchvision-derived building-block adaptations under their original
  MIT/BSD terms. See licenses/.

The MIT license on new code does NOT remove the noncommercial restriction on
MeWM-derived components or grant any rights to datasets and pretrained weights.
The attached publications and third-party pretrained weights are not included.

